# CONFIGURATION PREPARED — Cloudflare Pages `_headers` for Resident Portal
# Copy to resident-frontend/public/_headers (or Pages project) after HTTPS domains verified.
# Do NOT enable HSTS here until production TLS for portal.kissmetgroup.org is confirmed.
# Adjust connect-src if API hostname differs. Avoid unsafe-eval; Vite production builds do not need it.
# unsafe-inline for style may be required by some CSS-in-JS — prefer hashes/nonces when feasible.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.kissmetgroup.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; upgrade-insecure-requests
# Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
# ^^^ Enable ONLY after portal HTTPS verified (PRODUCTION DASHBOARD / edge action).
